# project.mdc — Per-repository configuration (edit for this project only)

> **Only `project-context/*.mdc` differs when copying the kit.** Replace `TBD` and `<placeholders>` before running SDLC.

```yaml
project:
  name: TBD  # repo folder name or service id
  displayName: TBD
  type: backend-service  # backend-service | frontend-app | monolith | microservice | library

repositories:
  primary: <org>/<repo>
  modifiable:
    - <org>/<repo>
  readOnly: []
  involved:
    - <org>/<repo>
  localWorkspace: true

technology:
  languages:
    - TBD
  languageVersions: {}
  frameworks: []
  buildTool: TBD  # sbt | maven | gradle | npm | pip | poetry | other
  testCommands:
    fullSuite: TBD
    singleClass: TBD
  packageRoots: []
  routeConfigPatterns: []

bugbot:
  enabled: true
  repoUrl: https://github.com/<org>/<repo>
  triggerOnDraftPr: true
  triggerComment: "/bugbot"
  botLogins:
    - cursor-bugbot
    - bugbot
  setupDoc: .cursor/docs/bugbot-setup.md

jira:
  enabled: true
  baseUrl: https://company.atlassian.net
  projectKey: TBD
  projectStyle: team-managed
  issueTypes:
    epic: Epic
    story: Story
    task: Task
    subtask: Sub-task

branching:
  defaultBranch: master
  mergeStrategy: merge
  commitConvention: conventional

dependencies:
  internal: []
  external: []

agentVerification:
  runLocally: true  # agents may run compile/test locally during execution; pre-PR sync still runs minimum compile
  ciCommands:
    compile: TBD  # e.g. sbt compile — mandatory at pre-PR sync for every feature
    unitTests: TBD
  skipLocal: []  # empty when runLocally is true; set deferTo for CI as secondary evidence
  deferTo:
    - CI pipeline after PR push
    - pre-PR gate requires deps/versions reconciled, compile pass, gh pr checks green (all work types)

constraints:
  - Do not commit secrets, tokens, or .env files
  - SDLC agents must not run local build/test/runtime unless runLocally is true
  - Do not edit .cursor/ kit files (docs, skills, sdlc-system) — only .cursor/project-context/*.mdc is per-project
```
